For the WAXS peaks, we calculated an average Bragg peak intensity IAL and the azimuthal position ψ of the [010]AL axis. To obtain the average azimuthal position ψ, we averaged all four azimuthal positions for 010AL, 020AL, 110AL, and \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
